1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,975
Take a ten-minute walk after you eat. Here's what it does.

2
00:00:05,225 --> 00:00:09,604
After a meal, your blood sugar rises. Moving helps your body use it.

3
00:00:10,854 --> 00:00:15,057
One. It can help digestion, and ease that heavy, bloated feeling.

4
00:00:16,007 --> 00:00:19,226
Two. It helps you avoid the after-lunch energy crash.

5
00:00:20,176 --> 00:00:24,240
Three. It's easy. Walk around the house, or take a call on foot.

6
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:28,155
Do you walk after meals? Tell me in the comments.

7
00:00:29,805 --> 00:00:32,566
Follow me for more health and wellness content.

